{title: Ek Tukda Dhoop Ka}
{artist: Raghav Chaitanya}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Toot ke hum [F]dono [C]mein,        [F]Jo bacha [C]woh [F]kam sa [C]hai
[C]Ek tukda [F]dhoop [C]ka,        [F]Andar [C]andar [F]namm sa [C]hai
Ek [Dm]dhaage mein hain [F]uljhe yoon,        Ke [C]bunte [F]bunte [C]khul gaye
Hum [Dm]the likhe [F]deewaron pe,        [C]Baarish huyi [F]aur [C]dhul gaye
[C]Toot ke hum [F]dono [C]mein,        [F]Jo bacha [C]woh [F]kam sa [C]hai
[C]Ek tukda [F]dhoop [C]ka,        [F]Andar [C]andar [F]namm sa [C]hai
[C]Socho zara kya the [Dm]hum haaye,        [Dm]Kya se kya [C]ho gaye
[C]Hizra wali raat [Dm]on ki [F]haaye,        [Dm]Kabr mein [C]so gaye
Ho [Dm]tum humare [G]jitne the,        [Dm]Sach kaho kya [G]utne the
[C]Jaane do [Dm]mat kaho [F]kitne the [C],        [C]Toot ke hum [F]dono [C]mein
[F]Jo bacha [C]woh [F]kam sa [C]hai,        [C]Ek tukda [F]dhoop [C]ka
[F]Andar [C]andar [F]namm sa [C]hai
